🟠 cart in shop (prod-eu-1) keeps running out of memory because its memory limit is too low for normal use. It was killed within 10 seconds of starting. Two restarts since its pod was created one hour ago. Fix in: deployment/cart → container app → resources.limits.memory (64Mi). To read the output of the last crash, run kubectl logs cart-532cd6e1-a -c app -n shop --previous
Checked: both replicas fail, on 2 nodes.
